WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.030
Module 7 builds on earlier SQL ideas You should
already recognize

00:00:06.044 --> 00:00:12.645
basic SELECT queries aggregate functions simple
joins and NULL Subqueries

00:00:12.671 --> 00:00:18.330
combine those familiar pieces in a new structure If
you can read a simple

00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:22.265
query on its own the main new skill is understanding
how the result of one

00:00:22.278 --> 00:00:23.738
query is used by another
